  "dct_description_sm": [
    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000rzxu](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000rzxu) Magnitude 5.5 earthquake at 10.633 depth occurred on Feb 24 2026 25km SW of Palau Insumoar Island. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -2.1052 longitude 138.8515. It impacted 11721 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
